### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Products
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### Create order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "customer_email": "student@example.com"
}

### Discount
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/discount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1000,
  "discount_percent": 0
}

### Slow request demo
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "customer_email": "slow@example.com",
  "order_number": "SLOW-001",
  "simulate_slow": true
}
